The charge alarm no longer breaks through Do Not Disturb

It used to vibrate and play its sound directly, and neither is a notification — so Do Not Disturb never applied, and the channel's "override Do Not Disturb" switch had no effect. Both now go through the notification channel, where DND applies and that switch is the real control.

Side effects: the channel is recreated once, and on Android 13+ the alarm needs notification permission.
